url: https://github.com/ccluett/pv-calc
abstract: >-
  A Python library and command-line tool for external-pressure vessel
  calculations. It covers tube stress, flat circular plates,
  hemispherical heads, NASA smooth-cylinder buckling, and NASA ring-stiffened
  shell general instability through a versioned JSON contract. Results include
  formula sources, assumptions, and validity checks. They come from idealized
  models and do not constitute design approval.
